00:08:14.527 --> 00:08:15.394 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Applause ]

00:08:15.394 --> 00:08:17.129 align:start size:94% position:6%
A new study found
that today's students

00:08:17.129 --> 00:08:18.598 align:start size:94% position:6%
think they learn
more from YouTube

00:08:18.598 --> 00:08:21.300 align:start size:94% position:6%
than they do from textbooks.
-Yeah.

00:08:21.300 --> 00:08:23.002 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, really?
I mean, it sounds odd,

00:08:23.002 --> 00:08:24.437 align:start size:94% position:6%
but you actually can
learn a lot --

00:08:24.437 --> 00:08:27.373
the same lessons that you'd find
in a textbook on YouTube.

00:08:27.373 --> 00:08:28.674 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'll -- I'll show you
what I mean.

00:08:28.674 --> 00:08:30.243 align:start size:94% position:6%
For instance, if you're
studying biology,

00:08:30.243 --> 00:08:31.244 align:start size:94% position:6%
the textbook
will tell you that,

00:08:31.244 --> 00:08:32.945 align:start size:94% position:6%
