are aggressive reptiles

00:08:32.945 --> 00:08:35.248 align:start size:94% position:6%
that do not like
to be provoked."

00:08:35.248 --> 00:08:36.582 align:start size:94% position:6%
But YouTube will
just show you this.

00:08:36.582 --> 00:08:38.184
-Do they know each other?
-Let's stay over here by Joanie.

00:08:38.184 --> 00:08:40.253 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Do they know each --
-They -- Oh, hold him tight.

00:08:40.253 --> 00:08:43.089
Hold him tight. Hold him tight.
-I am. I am!

00:08:43.089 --> 00:08:44.657 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Hold him tight.
-I am! I am!

00:08:44.657 --> 00:08:46.692 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You got him.
-I am!

00:08:46.692 --> 00:08:47.827 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-"I am! I am!"

00:08:47.827 --> 00:08:49.028 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:08:49.028 --> 00:08:50.329 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
"I am!"

00:08:50.329 --> 00:08:51.697 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Just hold it.
Hold it."

00:08:51.697 --> 00:08:54.233 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Light laughter ]

00:08:54.233 --> 00:08:55.067 size:81% position:41% line:92%
-Why would he hold it?

00:08:55.067 --> 00:08:57.603 align:start size:94% position:6%
-"Just -- Just hold it."
Oh, good -- good instruction.

00:08:57.603 --> 00:08:58.471 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:08:58.471 --> 00:08:59.372 line:92%
Next, if you're studying music,

00:08:59.372 --> 00:09:02.608 align:start size:94% position:6%
a textbook will tell you that,
"One voice is a soloist.

00:09:02.608 --> 00:09:04.577 align:start size:94% position:6%
Several voices
make up a chorus."

00:09:04.577 --> 00:09:07.847 align:start size:94% position:6%
But YouTube
will just show you this.

00:09:07.847 --> 00:09:08.781 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:09:08.781 --> 00:09:10.483 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Air hisses, squeaks ]

00:09:10.483 --> 00:09:11.751 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Air hisses ]

00:09:11.751 --> 00:09:13.619 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Loud wailing ]

00:09:13.619 --> 00:09:16.556 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughs ]
[ Applause ]

00:09:16.556 --> 00:09:18.724 align:start size:94% position:6%
