00:09:28.434 --> 00:09:30.469 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:09:31.203 --> 00:09:33.139 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:09:33.139 --> 00:09:35.975 align:start size:94% position:6%
YouTube has so much
